# supabase
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp
**/.supabase
# Migrations (supabase/migrations/*.sql) MUST stay tracked — they are the schema
# history. Only local seed data and one-off apply helpers are ignored here.
supabase/seed.sql
supabase/APPLY_*.sql

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
# A pattern with no slash matches at EVERY depth, not just the repo root.
# `templates.ts`, `database.ts` and `src/types` used to sit here and quietly
# excluded live source: src/lib/documents/templates.ts, src/types/app.ts and
# src/types/supabase.ts never reached the repo. Local builds passed (the files
# are on disk) while Vercel failed with
#   Module not found: Can't resolve '@/lib/documents/templates'
# src/types/supabase.ts is generated by `npm run db:types`, but it MUST stay
# tracked — the deploy build does not regenerate it. Scope any new rule to a
# path (`/build`, `supabase/seed.sql`) rather than a bare filename.
project_code.txt
*.sql